    "intro_narrative": "You have breached the server room of Project Chimera, a clandestine black-ops data center. The air is freezing, kept supercooled for the racks of humming mainframes that surround you. Red emergency lights pulse rhythmically, casting long, shifting shadows. Your objective is locked inside the Primary Vault, a heavy bio-metric container in the center of the room. The facility's security protocols have been scrambled, leaving a trail of disconnected tools and locked containers. You must navigate the fragmented system, utilizing various encryption modules and terminals to bypass the safeguards. Time is running out before the automated security countermeasures purge the room of oxygen. You need to link the correct data streams to override the locks.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
